# Lazarus System Binary Masquerading | T1036.005 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules-emerging-threats/2017/TA/Lazarus/proc_creation_win_apt_lazarus_binary_masquerading.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1 (Image IN ("*\\msdtc.exe", "*\\gpsvc.exe")) NOT (Image IN ("C:\\Windows\\System32\\*", "C:\\Windows\\SysWOW64\\*"))
